  "description": "Five years ago, while working as an investigative reporter, Kang Baek-Jun went undercover to expose a sinister cult operating in a remote rural village. The deep-seated trauma from the horrific incident he suffered there forced him to abandon investigative journalism altogether. Now working as an entertainment reporter, Baek-Jun finds himself on the brink of losing his job due to poor performance. Desperate to save his career, he takes on an exclusive interview with Seo Yo-Han, a hugely popular rookie model. \n\nHowever, Yo-Han acts as if he has known Baek-Jun for a very long time, deliberately unearthing the dark, forgotten horrors Baek-Jun tried so hard to bury. As Yo-Han corners him, he whispers a chillingly intimate plea: \n\n *\"Choke me like you did back then. After all, you're the one who gave me this kink.\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
